{"ID":"20230927143342-4pqvgsb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927143342-4pqvgsb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143342-4pqvgsb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143345-j2vuovp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143345-c4jokqy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143345-c4jokqy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:18,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:18\u0026#125;","title":"【大陷胸丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927143345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927143345-j2vuovp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143345-j2vuovp","updated":"20230927143345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸丸方：大黄半斤、葶苈半斤（熬）、芒硝半斤、杏仁半斤（去皮尖，熬）"}]},{"ID":"20230927143345-mkvewdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143345-mkvewdk","updated":"20230927143345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，捣筛二味，纳杏仁、芒硝，和研如脂，和散，取如弹丸一枚，别捣甘遂末一方寸匙，白蜜二合，水二升，煮取一升，去滓，温顿服之，一宿乃下。如不下，更服，取下为度。禁忌如药法。"}]},{"ID":"20230927143345-c4jokqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143345-c4jokqy","updated":"20230927143345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（注：大陷胸丸是六味药，不是四味药）"}]}]}